==English==

===Etymology===
From [[cripple]] + [[ware]] a contraction of [[software]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{uncountable|computing}} A program whose functionality is severely limited beyond that of [[shareware]], often in the interest of its author having the crippleware user make a purchase of the uncrippled program.
#:''Eos's PhotoModeler Lite is '''crippleware'''.''

